      "role": "Captain",
      "bio": "Conan grew up sailing in the Scottish Borders, first learning to sail on inland reservoirs at school before progressing into a professional yachting career. Holding an MCA Master 200 qualification, Conan has spent the past 10 years working aboard a range of performance sailing yachts and\nsuperyachts, including Wallys, J-Class yachts and a 56m ketch. He is known as a steady-handed, analytical and hardworking captain with strong\nsailing and engineering experience. Outside of yachting, Conan enjoys climbing, following the Tour de France and travelling.\nLanguages: English (first), Spanish (basic)\nAdditional Certificates: MCA Master 200, ENG 1 Medical"
    }
